		<trans-unit id="HDI2_Text7" resname="HDI2_Text7">
			<source>There are also 2 methods which have been implemented in order to respond exactly like AP Get field info and AP Get table info. These commands could be imported inside your database, for the same kind of analysis. &#13;&#13;</source>
