		</trans-unit>
		<trans-unit id="HDI2_Text20" resname="HDI2_Text20">
			<source>Get field info ( numTable ; numField ; relTable ; relFld ; props ; choiceList )&#13;      with:&#13;         numTable (Integer): Table number &#9;&#13;         numField (Integer):  Field number &#9;&#13;         relTable (Integer):    Related table &#9;&#13;         relFld (Integer):        Related field &#9;&#13;         props (Longint):       Field properties &#9;&#13;         choiceList  (String): Choice list</source>
			<target>Get field info ( numTable ; numField ; relTable ; relFld ; props ; choiceList )&#13;      with:&#13;         numTable (Integer): Table number &#9;&#13;         numField (Integer):  Field number &#9;&#13;         relTable (Integer):    Related table &#9;&#13;         relFld (Integer):        Related field &#9;&#13;         props (Longint):       Field properties &#9;&#13;         choiceList  (String): Choice list</target>
		</trans-unit>
		<trans-unit id="HDI2_Text21" resname="HDI2_Text21">
			<source>Get table info  ( numTable ; invisible ; destruct ) &#13;      with:&#13;         numTable (Integer): Table number &#9;&#13;         invisible (Integer):   1, if the table is invisible 0, if the table is visible &#9;&#13;         destruct (Integer):  1, for physical deletion of the records 0, for logical deletion of the records &#9;&#13;&#13; </source>
			<target>Get table info  ( numTable ; invisible ; destruct ) &#13;      with:&#13;         numTable (Integer): Table number &#9;&#13;         invisible (Integer):   1, if the table is invisible 0, if the table is visible &#9;&#13;         destruct (Integer):  1, for physical deletion of the records 0, for logical deletion of the records &#9;&#13;&#13; </target>
